<p class="govuk-body">You may be asked to take drug tests even if you have not previously used drugs.</p>
<p class="govuk-body">You must not do anything to tamper with your drug test.</p>
<p class="govuk-body">If you think something could affect your result, let the person taking your test know before the test is done.</p>
<p class="govuk-body">You can check with <a class="govuk-link" href="/probation-officer" data-tracking-id="licence_condition_help_drug_tests_probation_officer_link">your probation officer</a> what appointments and activities you need to take part in as part of this licence condition.</p>
